                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "db824efe-e7b1-4664-8bab-aa63b996e8e8",
                        "entry_id": "5aa70bb3-dfc5-3422-b69e-c28c8ddfa95f",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "rhèmes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a45a5844-d28f-32cc-96bd-5983b04183c5",
                        "entry_id": "5aa70bb3-dfc5-3422-b69e-c28c8ddfa95f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Information nouvelle dans une phrase qui sert à préciser le thème."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a778c03-09e5-4a36-8b4d-812a8cf89e78",
                                "sense_id": "a45a5844-d28f-32cc-96bd-5983b04183c5",
                                "text": "La neige, dans la première des deux phrases suivantes : Il neige. Cette neige forme une couche mince sur le sol., est le thème, et dans la seconde phrase, elle est le rhème."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e64695c0-2da7-4729-b93f-c793bcce9f12",
                                "sense_id": "a45a5844-d28f-32cc-96bd-5983b04183c5",
                                "text": "Le verbe être est particulier en raison de son double usage. Lorsqu’il est attribué seul à un sujet, il est un rhème qui signifie l’existence (cet usage est tout à fait courant en grec : « L’homme est », c’est-à-dire « l’homme existe »). — (Annick Stevens, Aristote, un fondateur méconnu, L’atinoir, 2019, p. 20)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d5ce2a71-d6bc-4106-bad6-02e0f9c72a09",
                                "sense_id": "a45a5844-d28f-32cc-96bd-5983b04183c5",
                                "text": "De la même manière l’interrogation peut faire ressortir l’élément rhématique ; il suffit de considérer la phrase que l’on étudie comme une réponse à diverses questions […] Le rhème est par définition l’élément sur lequel porte l’interrogation et le thème ce que cette interrogation présuppose acquis."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "436b86fb-b7d2-44ef-b219-aea3fb1b3114",
                        "source_entry_id": "5aa70bb3-dfc5-3422-b69e-c28c8ddfa95f",
                        "source_sense_id": "a45a5844-d28f-32cc-96bd-5983b04183c5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Rhema",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Rhema",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e97653e-1399-332b-8261-4c4c076e01bf",
                                        "entry_id": "af991f19-d574-31d5-b254-2e8124b56628",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "derjenige Teil eines Satzes, auf den der Sprecher/Schreiber die Aufmerksamkeit des Hörers/Lesers lenken will, meistens mit neuer Information"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "special"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6841c01c-5e08-40d3-b5d9-e866c15e19e3",
                                                "sense_id": "0e97653e-1399-332b-8261-4c4c076e01bf",
                                                "text": "In „Peter kommt heute nach Hause“ ist „Peter“ das Thema des Satzes, „kommt nach Hause“ das Rhema, wenn „nach Hause“ den Satzakzent trägt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7fafe2f7-69ae-4b15-a7da-bfb82e7fa009",
                                                "sense_id": "0e97653e-1399-332b-8261-4c4c076e01bf",
                                                "text": "„Mit den in der linguistischen Diskussion häufig erscheinenden Begriffspaaren ‚Thema - Rhema‘, ‚Topic - Comment‘ oder ‚Präsupposition - Focus‘ verbinden sich vom Ausgangspunkt her unterschiedliche, in ihrer Entwicklung aber konvergierende Ansätze, welche sich mit dem Phänomen befassen, daß die Komponenten eines Satzes hinsichtlich ihres Aussagecharakters und hinsichtlich ihres Informationswertes unterschiedlichen Status haben.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9642b4bd-4d5a-4625-a7e9-516125c388c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "5aa70bb3-dfc5-3422-b69e-c28c8ddfa95f",
                        "source_sense_id": "a45a5844-d28f-32cc-96bd-5983b04183c5",
                        "target_lang_word": "comment",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "comment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0e24caa4-8c6a-39dc-8935-3403848e47f1",
                                        "entry_id": "36be025f-cee0-3712-bc45-eee09a5243d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A spoken or written remark."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "385e14f4-01e0-4284-91d9-f7b27aafc119",
                                                "sense_id": "0e24caa4-8c6a-39dc-8935-3403848e47f1",
                                                "text": "I have no comment on that."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7cbbe30d-e540-4552-bf67-8e01096c08be",
                                                "sense_id": "0e24caa4-8c6a-39dc-8935-3403848e47f1",
                                                "text": "Pay attention to the teacher's comments in the margin of your marked essay."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "43ffa7ee-2bc8-4724-8a1a-4e7bc20af51a",
                                                "sense_id": "0e24caa4-8c6a-39dc-8935-3403848e47f1",
                                                "text": "“A tight little craft,” was Austin’s invariable comment on the matron; and she looked it, always trim and trig and smooth of surface like a converted yacht cleared for action."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f97bb98-9bef-46e4-81be-957e901fbab6",
                                                "sense_id": "0e24caa4-8c6a-39dc-8935-3403848e47f1",
                                                "text": "Santorum, in a comment regarding Senator John McCain's repudiation of torture, stated, \"He doesn't understand how enhanced interrogation works. I mean, you break somebody, and after they've broken they become cooperative\" (Summers 2011)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "867cdd27-b0f5-3ae4-b614-e4c7bc934e23",
                                        "entry_id": "36be025f-cee0-3712-bc45-eee09a5243d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of commenting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6debe928-ebac-4fdf-b10d-26d3ce486847",
                                                "sense_id": "867cdd27-b0f5-3ae4-b614-e4c7bc934e23",
                                                "text": "People bled to death like gentlemen in an operating room or expired without comment in an oxygen tent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d7480d6-ea23-3057-b9c1-8dc4b616c24a",
                                        "entry_id": "36be025f-cee0-3712-bc45-eee09a5243d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The part of a sentence that provides new information regarding the current theme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "707cb2b7-34a2-31b7-bbe6-b06ddf7e1d11",
                                        "entry_id": "36be025f-cee0-3712-bc45-eee09a5243d2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A remark embedded in source code in such a way that it will be ignored by the compiler or interpreter, typically to help people to understand the code."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "comment",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f9e2fca-5385-34e9-9316-3491b6322d28",
                                        "entry_id": "1308ba6e-d562-3325-8797-e7edefc280de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To remark."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8cc5ca5-fc08-47c1-b06a-43d9c69bac40",
                                                "sense_id": "6f9e2fca-5385-34e9-9316-3491b6322d28",
                                                "text": "“My Continental prominence is improving,” I commented dryly. ¶ Von Lindowe cut at a furze bush with his silver-mounted rattan. ¶ “Quite so,” he said as dryly, his hand at his mustache. “I may say if your intentions were known your life would not be worth a curse.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a2f8b89-e6fc-4877-ad80-d2b492a235d0",
                                                "sense_id": "6f9e2fca-5385-34e9-9316-3491b6322d28",
                                                "text": "\"A fine man, that Dunwody, yonder,\" commented the young captain, as they parted, and as he turned to his prisoner. \"We'll see him on in Washington some day. He is strengthening his forces now against Mr. Benton out there.[…].\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51f44e82-9dd7-4d4c-ada9-bcfc18976e70",
                                                "sense_id": "6f9e2fca-5385-34e9-9316-3491b6322d28",
                                                "text": "I think Mamet always comments that commerce really comes down to just a confidence game"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5c8a24b-c94a-46ce-82f9-8621d6a74395",
                                                "sense_id": "6f9e2fca-5385-34e9-9316-3491b6322d28",
                                                "text": "As Cambridge historian Mervyn James commented, \"silly quarrels escalated into battles in the streets.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "435e466e-5aad-3502-a763-76bec96591d6",
                                        "entry_id": "1308ba6e-d562-3325-8797-e7edefc280de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make remarks or notes; to express a view regarding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "322b0785-efff-4af8-ab3b-ce395acbe01a",
                                                "sense_id": "435e466e-5aad-3502-a763-76bec96591d6",
                                                "text": "He commented about your proposal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "61b2d55e-53ab-46e8-baf4-f0da26eb8355",
                                                "sense_id": "435e466e-5aad-3502-a763-76bec96591d6",
                                                "text": "The movie comments on race relations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2ac76d48-0054-3baf-b207-425e13425856",
                                        "entry_id": "1308ba6e-d562-3325-8797-e7edefc280de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To comment or remark on."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c769c1c-a357-492a-bf5c-cb20c76064ab",
                                                "sense_id": "2ac76d48-0054-3baf-b207-425e13425856",
                                                "text": "[…]who have expounded Scripture out of its Senses, and have so Commented the Laws thereof"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3047cef5-3627-33a9-b855-56f1c8dddd8a",
                                        "entry_id": "1308ba6e-d562-3325-8797-e7edefc280de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To insert comments into (source code)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e6c4d19-896f-46a0-a7aa-48d4809c03e7",
                                                "sense_id": "3047cef5-3627-33a9-b855-56f1c8dddd8a",
                                                "text": "I wish I'd commented this complicated algorithm back when I remembered how it worked."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1741ea1-c90b-3765-9439-650248b64cd8",
                                        "entry_id": "1308ba6e-d562-3325-8797-e7edefc280de",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To comment out (code); to disable by converting into a comment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
